+Create cornerstone.png, 1024×1024. A single squat massive squared granite block in front three-quarter view, huge smooth FLAT BLANK front face occupying about 60 percent of block width reserved for a future multiplier. Keep this front uninterrupted, unmarked and empty. Chipped corners and edges, small ferns and a few stones at foot, a small painted explosion-star stencil on SIDE face only. Block fills about 85% canvas, complete composition with 3–6% minimum clear margin all around. No scenic backdrop.
+CORRECTION REQUIRED: deliver exactly 1024 by 1024 pixels. Squat wide block, not tall slab. Scale entire subject down: all opaque pixels including plants and pebbles MUST stay inside x=55..969 and y=55..969. No stray pixels. Small side stencil, not a large emblem. Front face clean solid flat color without speckled grain. Crisp ink and flat cel colors, no texture noise.

